  "hindi": "हे सोम और पूषन्, अन्तरिक्ष के मापक, सात चक्रों वाले, सबको प्रेरित न करने वाले, अलग-अलग दिशाओं में घूमने वाले, मन से जोड़े जाते हुए, पाँच रस्सियों वाले उस रथ को, हे दोनों बैलो, तुम दोनों गति देते हो।",
  "english": "O Soma and Pūṣan, you two bulls quicken that chariot, the measure of the realm of space, seven-wheeled, not impelling everything, turning in different directions, being yoked by the mind, five-reined.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "Obscure verse. aviśvaminvam is uncertain (a-viśva-minva \"not impelling everything\", or a different analysis). viṣūvṛtam \"turning in different directions\" is a literal reading. rajasaḥ vimānam could also be \"measurer of the dusky region\". The chariot is not identified.",
